.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-harvest-id-register 1  "register " 
.SH NAME
git\-harvest\-id\-register \- Register a contributor under a chosen alias
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-harvest id register\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIALIAS\fR> <\fINAME\fR> <\fIEMAIL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register a contributor under a chosen alias.
.PP
Adds a contributor immediately under a chosen alias, for a bot or a person who has not committed yet and so cannot be auto\-registered by `scan`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIALIAS\fR>
The alias to credit this contributor as
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The contributor\*(Aqs name
.TP
<\fIEMAIL\fR>
The contributor\*(Aqs e\-mail address
